{"id":28,"titleZh":"什么是奏鸣曲式？","titleEn":"What Is Sonata Form?","date":"1964-11-06","dateZh":"1964 年 11 月 6 日","concepts":"三段体平衡、主调与属调磁力、呈示—展开—再现","thesis":"交响曲第一乐章并不像表格那样枯燥——奏鸣曲式本质上就是“从主调出发、去远方调性冒险、最终回到主调老家”的三幕结构。","plain":"画作一目了然，音乐却必须在时间里靠记忆连成整体。奏鸣曲式能够沿用两百年，全靠自然平衡的三段体（A-B-A）与调性引力：呈示部离家转向对比调，展开部把主题打碎闯荡陌生调性，再现部则把所有主题按秩序带回原本的主调。","scenes":["前后对比实验：开场不解说直接演奏莫扎特《朱庇特交响曲》第一乐章，全课讲透后再重演一遍，现场请 9 位音乐学院大学生排成队，随着乐句进展依次举牌提示“呈示部 / 展开部 / 再现部”。","用钢琴连贯演示“三段体”从简到繁的进化：先弹儿歌《小星星》，再亲弹亲唱披头士的《And I Love Her》，接着女高音演唱歌剧《卡门》咏叹调，最后敲响披头士与莫扎特钢琴奏鸣曲讲解主和弦回到归宿感。"],"category":"基础乐理","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1ZE41197e7","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ZE41197e7","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 什么是奏鸣曲式","duration":"53:11","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/what-is-sonata-form","repertoire":[{"composer":"Mozart","piece":"Symphony No. 41 in C Major, K. 551 (Jupiter, 1st Movement)","titleZh":"朱庇特交响曲第一乐章","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview125/v4/80/1c/1d/801c1dc9-c14c-f5bf-7ca9-f39ad3325d4f/mzaf_1303989186037093550.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/symphony-no-41-in-c-major-k-551-i-allegro-vivace/930644673?i=930644683&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Mozart Festival Orchestra & Richard Edlinger","recordingTrack":"Symphony No. 41 in C Major, K. 551: I. Allegro vivace","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Mozart%20Symphony%20No.%2041%20in%20C%20Major%2C%20K.%20551+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Mozart%20Symphony%20No.%2041%20in%20C%20Major%2C%20K.%20551"},{"composer":"The Beatles","piece":"And I Love Her","titleZh":"我爱她","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=The%20Beatles%20And%20I%20Love%20Her+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=The%20Beatles%20And%20I%